      "sourceTitle": "Doocs 0215.Kth Largest Element in an Array Solution 2: Priority Queue (Min Heap)",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/doocs/leetcode/blob/main/solution/0200-0299/0215.Kth%20Largest%20Element%20in%20an%20Array/README_EN.md",
      "code": "class Solution {\npublic:\n    int findKthLargest(vector<int>& nums, int k) {\n        priority_queue<int, vector<int>, greater<int>> minQ;\n        for (int x : nums) {\n            minQ.push(x);\n            if (minQ.size() > k) {\n                minQ.pop();\n            }\n        }\n        return minQ.top();\n    }\n};"
