      "code": "class Solution {\npublic:\n    int stoneGameVIII(vector<int>& stones) {\n        int n = stones.size();\n        for (int i = 1; i < n; ++i) {\n            stones[i] += stones[i - 1];\n        }\n        int f = stones.back();\n        for (int i = n - 2; i; --i) {\n            f = max(f, stones[i] - f);\n        }\n        return f;\n    }\n};"
