      "code": "class Solution {\npublic:\n    vector<int> transformArray(vector<int>& nums) {\n        int even = 0;\n        for (int x : nums) {\n            even += (x & 1 ^ 1);\n        }\n        for (int i = 0; i < even; ++i) {\n            nums[i] = 0;\n        }\n        for (int i = even; i < nums.size(); ++i) {\n            nums[i] = 1;\n        }\n        return nums;\n    }\n};"
