      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/doocs/leetcode/blob/main/solution/1800-1899/1863.Sum%20of%20All%20Subset%20XOR%20Totals/README.md",
      "code": "class Solution {\npublic:\n    int subsetXORSum(vector<int>& nums) {\n        int n = nums.size();\n        int ans = 0;\n        for (int i = 0; i < 1 << n; ++i) {\n            int s = 0;\n            for (int j = 0; j < n; ++j) {\n                if (i >> j & 1) {\n                    s ^= nums[j];\n                }\n            }\n            ans += s;\n        }\n        return ans;\n    }\n};"
