      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/doocs/leetcode/blob/main/solution/1600-1699/1626.Best%20Team%20With%20No%20Conflicts/README.md",
      "code": "class Solution {\npublic:\n    int bestTeamScore(vector<int>& scores, vector<int>& ages) {\n        int n = ages.size();\n        vector<pair<int, int>> arr(n);\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; ++i) {\n            arr[i] = {scores[i], ages[i]};\n        }\n        sort(arr.begin(), arr.end());\n        vector<int> f(n);\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; ++i) {\n            for (int j = 0; j < i; ++j) {\n                if (arr[i].second >= arr[j].second) {\n                    f[i] = max(f[i], f[j]);\n                }\n            }\n            f[i] += arr[i].first;\n        }\n        return *max_element(f.begin(), f.end());\n    }\n};"
