      "code": "class MaxQueue {\npublic:\n    MaxQueue() {\n    }\n\n    int max_value() {\n        return q2.empty() ? -1 : q2.front();\n    }\n\n    void push_back(int value) {\n        while (!q2.empty() && q2.back() < value) {\n            q2.pop_back();\n        }\n        q1.push(value);\n        q2.push_back(value);\n    }\n\n    int pop_front() {\n        if (q1.empty()) {\n            return -1;\n        }\n        int ans = q1.front();\n        q1.pop();\n        if (q2.front() == ans) {\n            q2.pop_front();\n        }\n        return ans;\n    }\n\nprivate:\n    queue<int> q1;\n    deque<int> q2;\n};\n\n/**\n * Your MaxQueue object will be instantiated and called as such:\n * MaxQueue* obj = new MaxQueue();\n * int param_1 = obj->max_value();\n * obj->push_back(value);\n * int param_3 = obj->pop_front();\n */"
