      "code": "class MyCalendarTwo {\npublic:\n    MyCalendarTwo() {\n    }\n\n    bool book(int startTime, int endTime) {\n        ++m[startTime];\n        --m[endTime];\n        int s = 0;\n        for (auto& [_, v] : m) {\n            s += v;\n            if (s > 2) {\n                --m[startTime];\n                ++m[endTime];\n                return false;\n            }\n        }\n        return true;\n    }\n\nprivate:\n    map<int, int> m;\n};\n\n/**\n * Your MyCalendarTwo object will be instantiated and called as such:\n * MyCalendarTwo* obj = new MyCalendarTwo();\n * bool param_1 = obj->book(startTime,endTime);\n */"
