      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/doocs/leetcode/blob/main/solution/2400-2499/2470.Number%20of%20Subarrays%20With%20LCM%20Equal%20to%20K/README.md",
      "code": "class Solution {\npublic:\n    int subarrayLCM(vector<int>& nums, int k) {\n        int n = nums.size();\n        int ans = 0;\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; ++i) {\n            int a = nums[i];\n            for (int j = i; j < n; ++j) {\n                int b = nums[j];\n                int x = lcm(a, b);\n                ans += x == k;\n                a = x;\n            }\n        }\n        return ans;\n    }\n};"
