      "code": "class Solution {\npublic:\n    long long waysToBuyPensPencils(int total, int cost1, int cost2) {\n        long long ans = 0;\n        for (int x = 0; x <= total / cost1; ++x) {\n            int y = (total - x * cost1) / cost2 + 1;\n            ans += y;\n        }\n        return ans;\n    }\n};"
