      "sourceTitle": "Doocs 3091.Apply Operations to Make Sum of Array Greater Than or Equal to k Reference",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/doocs/leetcode/blob/main/solution/3000-3099/3091.Apply%20Operations%20to%20Make%20Sum%20of%20Array%20Greater%20Than%20or%20Equal%20to%20k/README.md",
      "code": "class Solution {\npublic:\n    int minOperations(int k) {\n        int ans = k;\n        for (int a = 0; a < k; ++a) {\n            int x = a + 1;\n            int b = (k + x - 1) / x - 1;\n            ans = min(ans, a + b);\n        }\n        return ans;\n    }\n};"
