      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/doocs/leetcode/blob/main/solution/1800-1899/1846.Maximum%20Element%20After%20Decreasing%20and%20Rearranging/README.md",
      "code": "class Solution {\npublic:\n    int maximumElementAfterDecrementingAndRearranging(vector<int>& arr) {\n        sort(arr.begin(), arr.end());\n        arr[0] = 1;\n        int ans = 1;\n        for (int i = 1; i < arr.size(); ++i) {\n            int d = max(0, arr[i] - arr[i - 1] - 1);\n            arr[i] -= d;\n            ans = max(ans, arr[i]);\n        }\n        return ans;\n    }\n};"
