      "code": "class Solution {\npublic:\n    vector<int> beautifulArray(int n) {\n        if (n == 1) return {1};\n        vector<int> left = beautifulArray((n + 1) >> 1);\n        vector<int> right = beautifulArray(n >> 1);\n        vector<int> ans(n);\n        int i = 0;\n        for (int& x : left) ans[i++] = x * 2 - 1;\n        for (int& x : right) ans[i++] = x * 2;\n        return ans;\n    }\n};"
