      "sourceTitle": "Doocs 1290.Convert Binary Number in a Linked List to Integer Reference",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/doocs/leetcode/blob/main/solution/1200-1299/1290.Convert%20Binary%20Number%20in%20a%20Linked%20List%20to%20Integer/README.md",
      "code": "/**\n * Definition for singly-linked list.\n * struct ListNode {\n *     int val;\n *     ListNode *next;\n *     ListNode() : val(0), next(nullptr) {}\n *     ListNode(int x) : val(x), next(nullptr) {}\n *     ListNode(int x, ListNode *next) : val(x), next(next) {}\n * };\n */\nclass Solution {\npublic:\n    int getDecimalValue(ListNode* head) {\n        int ans = 0;\n        for (; head; head = head->next) {\n            ans = ans << 1 | head->val;\n        }\n        return ans;\n    }\n};"
