      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/doocs/leetcode/blob/main/solution/0500-0599/0559.Maximum%20Depth%20of%20N-ary%20Tree/README.md",
      "code": "/*\n// Definition for a Node.\nclass Node {\npublic:\n    int val;\n    vector<Node*> children;\n\n    Node() {}\n\n    Node(int _val) {\n        val = _val;\n    }\n\n    Node(int _val, vector<Node*> _children) {\n        val = _val;\n        children = _children;\n    }\n};\n*/\n\nclass Solution {\npublic:\n    int maxDepth(Node* root) {\n        if (!root) {\n            return 0;\n        }\n        int mx = 0;\n        for (Node* child : root->children) {\n            mx = max(mx, maxDepth(child));\n        }\n        return mx + 1;\n    }\n};"
